<div class="welcome-panel"><div class="welcome-story"><svg class="welcome-compass" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-compass"/></svg><h1>There’s room<br>for your ideas.</h1><p>You’ve been invited to plan a trip together. Share a place you love, save a useful link, or see what everyone’s thinking.</p><div class="welcome-points"><span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-link"/></svg>One shared research space</span><span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg>A conversation, not more tabs</span></div></div><section class="welcome-form"><% if (data.trip.is_demo) { %><span class="badge sample">Sample workspace</span><% } %><h2>Join <%= data.trip.name %></h2><p>What should your travel crew call you?</p><form method="post" action="/join/<%= data.token %>" class="stack-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label for="display-name">Your name<input id="display-name" name="name" autocomplete="nickname" required maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. Alex" value="<%= data.values && data.values.name || '' %>" autofocus></label><button class="button primary full-width">Join the trip<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></form><p class="fine-print">We’ll remember you in this browser for up to 7 days. Your name appears on your ideas, votes, and comments. It isn’t a verified identity.</p><div class="join-help"><strong>Keep this space within the group.</strong><p>Anyone with this link can join. Don’t add payment details or sensitive travel documents.</p></div></section></div>